# 16. Pattern Recognition

Agar problem mein:

- Function khud ko call kar sakta hai
- Problem smaller same-type problem mein break hoti hai
- Clear base case diya ja sakta hai
- Formula depends on smaller values

Toh recursion ke baare mein socho.

